---
name: cn
type: registry:lib
title: cn
description: Merge Tailwind class lists, resolving conflicts with tailwind-merge.
dependencies:
  - clsx
  - tailwind-merge
files:
  - path: src/lib/utils.ts
    type: registry:lib
    target: lib/utils.ts
---

`cn()` combines `clsx` (conditional class joining) with `tailwind-merge` (conflict resolution), so a later class wins over an earlier, conflicting one instead of both being applied.

```ts
import { cn } from "$lib/utils";

cn("px-2 py-1", isActive && "bg-primary", "px-4"); // => "py-1 bg-primary px-4"
```
